 "description": "<p>Narsarmijit (IATA: QFN),&nbsp;formerly Frederiksdal, is a settlement in southern Greenland. It is located in the Kujalleq municipality. Its population was 97 in 2010.&nbsp;There has been a slow but steady pattern of emigration since the late 1950s. Source: <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narsaq_Kujalleq\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a>.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.125em; line-height: 1.2em;\">For further information (in Danish) see also the Danish Geodata Agency:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.gronlandskehavnelods.dk/#HID=3\" style=\"font-size: 1.125em; line-height: 1.2em;\" target=\"_blank\">Den grønlandske Havnelods</a></p>",
